{"t":"Dwarven Ring","s":"dwarven-ring-3aa7f","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Dwarven_Ring_67bdd7.gif","q":35,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Dwarven Ring</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Dwarven Ring\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarven_Ring_67bdd7.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Combat Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"attrib\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Attributes</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">hard drinking</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Body Equipment<br/>Rings</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.10 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"duration\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Duration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">60 minutes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500 - 1500 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 17, 2002<br/>Christmas Update 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050602225039&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarven_Ring_67bdd7.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a dwarven ring <span class=\"p-attributes\">(hard drinking)</span> <span class=\"p-duration\">that is brand-new</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.10 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The Dwarven Ring prevents drunkenness and has energy for 60 minutes. It is helpful in slaying monsters that make you drunk, such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Assassin\">Assassins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Smith\">Cyclops Smiths</a>, Cults, <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinns</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dworc%20Voodoomaster\">Dworc Voodoomasters</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">Wyverns</a>.\n</p><p>Note that the character does not become sober, but the effects of drunkenness are inactive while the ring is worn: your character remains drunk. Thus, taking the ring off after you have killed all drunkenness-causing creatures will still render your character incapacitated.\n</p><p>In addition to the loot from various creatures, they can also be found inside <a href=\"#/wiki/Crate%20%28Usable%29\">Usable crates</a> that are around <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>.\n</p><p>Can be acquired by completing the <a href=\"#/quest/geomancer-quest\">Geomancer Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/waterfall-quest\">Waterfall Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/skull-of-ratha-quest\">Skull of Ratha Quest</a> and <a href=\"#/quest/triangle-tower-quest\">Triangle Tower Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Amenef%20the%20Burning\">Amenef the Burning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bulltaur%20Brute\">Bulltaur Brute</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Beggar\">Crazed Beggar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Dwarf\">Crazed Dwarf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Drillworm\">Drillworm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\">Dwarf Geomancer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Miner\">Dwarf Miner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gore%20Horn\">Gore Horn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gozzler\">Gozzler</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Haunted%20Treeling\">Haunted Treeling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lavafungus\">Lavafungus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Basher\">Lost Basher</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Berserker\">Lost Berserker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Exile\">Lost Exile</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Husher\">Lost Husher</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Madareth\">Madareth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Massive%20Earth%20Elemental\">Massive Earth Elemental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mindmasher\">Mindmasher</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Novice%20of%20the%20Cult\">Novice of the Cult</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Orewalker\">Orewalker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"